{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kedqCrO3xAZtO-1nXWx51g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:49.522604+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/kedqCrO3xAZtO-1nXWx51g","html":"<div><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为促进高校优秀学子之间的交流，增进大学生对国科大杭州高等研究院（以下简称“杭高院”）环境学院的了解，拓宽学术视野，并选拔具备深厚潜力的优秀大学生继续深造，我院将于暑期举办“杭高院环境学院</span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动”。现将招募营员的相关事宜通知如下：</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/SWZT5eHHhhxibE1JD8Char1dtGVicksOtFj3Maky2gzm5rhudibvvxbLTvplMUicxA40G4icgaKGzrPDV2gXibroNksCewPDhkyaeLc6qn2Z691ag/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SWZT5eHHhhxQEWAhbdZQic4P0JwKLpibibYqgumiaGQJvqQKmSK8P6AfGZu6CYoQqwjcZMzseuBJ9DEkYYlUylb67ytOzCr31yGQ9bjCrBLG1G8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span><span>杭高院及环境学院简介</span></span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>国科大杭州高等研究院创立于</span></span><span><span> 2019 </span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span> , </span></span><span><span>由中国科学院大学（简称“国科大”）和杭州市人民政府合作共建的一所高起点、小而精的教学科研机构，也是中国科学院大学的直属二级学院、杭州市直属正局级事业单位。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>环境学院是隶属于国科大杭州高等研究院的二级学院，由我国著名分析化学家、环境化学家江桂斌院士创建并担任院长，原环境化学与环境毒理全国重点实验室常务副主任郑明辉教授担任执行院长。环境学院由</span><span><span>中国科学院生态环境研究中心</span><span><span>环境化学与环境毒理全国重点实验室</span></span><span>参与承办，</span></span><span>建有全省新污染物环境与健康重点实验室，下设</span><span>11</span><span>个教授工作室及非靶标分析中心、环境样品库、二恶英实验室等平台。同时，中国分析测试协会新污染物专业委员会挂靠环境学院，还是中国分析测试协会培训基地和资质考核中心。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>学院面向环境污染与健康的国际前沿，面向区域性环境污染控制的国家重大需求，承担应用基础研究、专业人才培养和科技成果转化的三大任务。学院规划面积约两万多平米，已投入使用</span></span><span><span>8000</span></span><span><span>平米，已建成具备超</span></span><span><span>1.3</span></span><span><span>亿元先进仪器设备的综合性实验室平台。环境学院聚焦新污染物，力争在新污染物的筛选识别、毒理与人群健康和污染控制与健康保障技术三大方向上取得重大突破，推动我国环境化学与毒理学学科发展</span></span><span><span>,</span></span><span><span>同时在支撑国家履行斯德哥尔摩公约和水俣公约等方面发挥重要作用。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/SWZT5eHHhhxLdVPLIGYQ7e0Hy5uou0ADf4c8rkcR1aa7OFEt4RiboDAzWzctUjQou6o17DcibPZ0iaUGS7hKZYN62r7vl2hsqcFsQATC02Gslg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span><span>师资概况</span></span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>学院师资力量雄厚，现有</span></span><span><span>78</span></span><span><span>名教职工（全职</span></span><span><span>45</span></span><span><span>名，双聘</span></span><span><span>33</span></span><span><span>名），包括中国科学院院士</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人，国家级领军人才</span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span>人、国家级青年人才</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>人、浙江省级人才</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>人；以第一完成人身份三次获得国家自然科学二等奖，一次国家科学技术进步二等奖。</span></span><span><span>11</span></span><span><span>个教授工作室首席教授均为环境科学与健康相关领域内知名学者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院教授工作室聚焦学科前沿、极具发展前景：</span></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/SWZT5eHHhhyXCDFdetGicMwFsevlQLIRSu9vx4Nwxrjq9wYD15FNg63zMjW0qfdq6PRsb2Pu4KyNx1gmZj5B6Gt4CPSLFTrsibgib0gekMGcUs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><span>更多导师信息详见</span></span></p><p><span><span>http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/hjxy/ssdw1/yszj.htm</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SWZT5eHHhhxpMA7dj0SeP41gpiaHdUJWGCtrOylOjibTEh42ib4vbiaZlTS1ddia1GqAby4sEicLPREXWEmbGkiaGumGBtrM5UpEAPX3psBN8hCgJ0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span><span>招生专业</span></span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>环境科学（中国科学院生态环境研究中心代招，学术型硕士）</span></span></p><p><span><span>环境工程（杭高院独立招生，专业型硕士）</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SWZT5eHHhhwmiapnMYnheuv8ZwYwT44wCuyicRsbmFiaa6w20qJq3JKyTH6pFmfAdKhQCJfTxfvwLnrJERbyy1SUibiaG7iacpFYTTkwtSCicicnIRQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span><span>夏令营安排</span></span></strong></section></section></section></sec