/span></span><span><span>）学生证扫描件</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>）专业排名证明扫描件</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>）其他等级证书及校级以上获奖证书扫描件</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>）已发表论文或出版物扫描件</span></span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>）专家推荐信扫描件（若有可提供，非必须）</span></span></p><p><span><span>上述</span></span><span><span>1-9</span></span><span><span>材料按顺序做成一个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件（</span></span><span><span>1-6</span></span><span><span>为必交材料，</span></span><span><span>7-9</span></span><span><span>为选交材料），文件命名和主题：</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>优营申请</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>本科学校名称</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名，将文件发送至</span></span><span><strong><span><span><span>hjxy@ucas.ac.cn</span></span><span><span>，截止日期</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></span></strong></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>注：本次申请只需提交电子版材料，无需寄送纸质版，需要签字的材料请打印下来手签后扫描上传。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>资格审查</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请者的入选资格由专家委员会审定，确定入选名单后将通过邮件或电话通知被录取者本人。未入围的同学不再另行通知，敬请谅解。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>07</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/SWZT5eHHhhyvY5FZea5EGEPjZF5oee5MXjhQXcG0mib4EVhFvD7wOBsJ9844lfLmeOQlFN6XEka9rywCCJtBiaK67rs0Qbm2yhqabV43YXtVI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><font><span><b><span>其他说明</span></b></span></font></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、我院将为营员提供单程路费</span><strong><span>（仅面向按规定全程参与所有活动并顺利结营的营员，凭票实报实销高校所在城市至杭州的火车硬座</span></strong></span><strong><span><span>/</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>硬卧</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>/</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>动车二等座</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>/</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>高铁二等）</span></span></strong><span><span>，请将单程车票妥善保管，报道时提交，夏令营期间食宿由我院统一安排。提前到达或延迟离开期间的食宿费用自行承担。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、营员应遵守国科大杭高环境学院大学生暑期夏令营的各项规定，不得擅自离营，按照统一安排参加各项营内活动。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、未能入选本次夏令营</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>未获得优秀营员</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>未取得推免资格的同学，欢迎以统考方式报名加入环境学院。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>如暂不符合夏令营报名条件，欢迎各位优秀大学生以旁听生的身份参与此次夏令营活动。（报名方式与营员报名一致）</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>若有任何疑问请致电</span></span><span><span>0571-86080596</span></span><span><span>，联系邮件：</span></span><span><span>hjxy@ucas.ac.cn</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>其他未尽事宜遵照上级政策要求执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>了解「国科大杭州高等研究院」，请访问</span></span><span><span>http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>了解「国科大杭高院环境学院」，请访问</span></span><span><span>http://hias.ucas.ac.cn/hjxy/</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span><